# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Generated artefacts
#  Raw benchmark data (bench/results/*.jsonl) IS committed.
#  Figures are generated by `make figures` and are NOT.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bench/figures/
*.pdf
!docs/**/*.pdf
# The two instructor-recommended papers are open access and shared with the team,
# so everyone reads the same version.
!references/*.pdf

